{"title":"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Compute: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/8/3e85f1ca7e52f5f64e9e5ff565676aa1d6b28b5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{2000\\cdot 2007\\cdot 2008\\cdot 2015+784}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"253\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5f7f20023f54891f98b2a5965f9979486c26506.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{2000(2000+7)(2000+8)(2000+15)+784}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"358\" height=\"32\" />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3a35cb0da26a798e70737b0ac5887360fb6dd3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\sqrt{(2000^2+15\\cdot 2000+56)(2000^2+15\\cdot 2000)+28^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"421\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/2/a02c5ccec59447c2cb948ac474ab7b9cfbafa536.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\sqrt{(2000^2+15\\cdot 2000+28)(2000^2+15\\cdot 2000+28)-28^2+28^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"511\" height=\"35\" />\n</p>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/6/9961d0118f734285bf27fc9a006c2345338b17da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2000^2+15\\cdot 2000+28=\\boxed{4030028}$\" st